out.push("\n\n### 6.2 Color Swatch 的 HTML\n\n```html\n<fieldset>\n  <legend>Color</legend>\n\n  <input\n    type=\"radio\"\n    name=\"color\"\n    id=\"color-black\"\n    class=\"visually-hidden swatch-input\"\n    value=\"Black\"\n    checked\n  >\n\n  <label for=\"color-black\" class=\"swatch-label\">\n    <span\n      class=\"swatch\"\n      style=\"background-color: #333\"\n      aria-hidden=\"true\"\n    ></span>\n\n    <span>Black</span>\n  </label>\n\n  <input\n    type=\"radio\"\n    name=\"color\"\n    id=\"color-blue\"\n    class=\"visually-hidden swatch-input\"\n    value=\"Blue\"\n  >\n\n  <label for=\"color-blue\" class=\"swatch-label\">\n    <span\n      class=\"swatch\"\n      style=\"background-color: #8299b3\"\n      aria-hidden=\"true\"\n    ></span>\n\n    <span>Blue</span>\n  </label>\n\n</fieldset>\n```\n\n对应的无障碍树：\n\n```text\ngroup \"Color\"\n  radio \"Black\", checked\n  radio \"Blue\", not checked\n```\n\n### 6.3 Shopify 原生 Swatch 数据\n\n在 Shopify Liquid 中，`product_option_value` 可以提供 swatch 信息，例如：\n\n```liquid\n{% if value.swatch.color %}\n\n  <span\n    class=\"swatch\"\n    style=\"background-color: rgb({{ value.swatch.color.rgb }})\"\n    aria-hidden=\"true\"\n  ></span>\n\n{% elsif value.swatch.image %}\n\n  {{\n    value.swatch.image\n    | image_url: width: 100\n    | image_tag: alt: ''\n  }}\n\n{% endif %}\n\n<span>{{ value | escape }}</span>\n```\n\nSwatch 不仅可以是纯颜色，也可以是图片，例如格纹、木纹、皮革或织物纹理。\n\nDawn 的 `product-variant-options.liquid` 就会根据 `value.swatch.image` 和 `value.swatch.color` 决定 Swatch 的视觉呈现。");
