out.push("\n\n### 12.1 推荐 HTML 结构\n\n```html\n<label for=\"quantity\">Quantity</label>\n\n<div class=\"quantity-selector\">\n\n  <button\n    type=\"button\"\n    data-minus\n    aria-label=\"Decrease quantity\"\n    aria-controls=\"quantity\"\n  >\n    −\n  </button>\n\n  <input\n    id=\"quantity\"\n    type=\"number\"\n    name=\"quantity\"\n    value=\"1\"\n    min=\"1\"\n    max=\"10\"\n    step=\"1\"\n    required\n    aria-describedby=\"quantity-rules\"\n  >\n\n  <button\n    type=\"button\"\n    data-plus\n    aria-label=\"Increase quantity\"\n    aria-controls=\"quantity\"\n  >\n    +\n  </button>\n\n</div>\n\n<p id=\"quantity-rules\">\n  Minimum: 1. Maximum: 10.\n</p>\n```\n\n原生 `input[type=\"number\"]` 已经具有 spinbutton 语义、当前值和数值范围信息。\n\n不需要添加：\n\n```html\nrole=\"spinbutton\"\naria-valuenow=\"1\"\naria-valuemin=\"1\"\naria-valuemax=\"10\"\n```\n\n浏览器会根据原生属性计算这些信息。\n\n### 12.2 JavaScript 实现\n\n```javascript\nconst input = document.querySelector('#quantity');\n\nconst minus = document.querySelector('[data-minus]');\nconst plus = document.querySelector('[data-plus]');\n\nfunction syncButtons() {\n  const value = input.valueAsNumber;\n  const valid = input.validity.valid;\n\n  minus.setAttribute(\n    'aria-disabled',\n    String(!valid || value <= Number(input.min))\n  );\n\n  plus.setAttribute(\n    'aria-disabled',\n    String(!valid || (\n      input.max !== '' && value >= Number(input.max)\n    ))\n  );\n}\n\nfunction changeQuantity(button, direction) {\n  if (button.getAttribute('aria-disabled') === 'true') {\n    return;\n  }\n\n  if (direction > 0) {\n    input.stepUp();\n  } else {\n    input.stepDown();\n  }\n\n  input.dispatchEvent(\n    new Event('input', { bubbles: true })\n  );\n\n  input.dispatchEvent(\n    new Event('change', { bubbles: true })\n  );\n}\n\nminus.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  changeQuantity(minus, -1);\n});\n\nplus.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  changeQuantity(plus, 1);\n});\n\ninput.addEventListener('input', syncButtons);\n\nsyncButtons();\n```\n\n这里使用原生 `stepUp()` 和 `stepDown()`，而不是自己直接进行 `value + 1`。\n\n同时使用 `aria-disabled` 保留加减按钮的焦点。当用户连续点击加号到达最大数量时，不会因为按钮突然被原生禁用而丢失焦点。\n\n### 12.3 Shopify Quantity Rule\n\nShopify 的数量限制不一定是 min=1、step=1。\n\n实际项目需要根据 Variant 的数量规则处理：\n\n```liquid\n<input\n  type=\"number\"\n  name=\"quantity\"\n  min=\"{{ variant.quantity_rule.min }}\"\n  step=\"{{ variant.quantity_rule.increment }}\"\n  {% if variant.quantity_rule.max != null %}\n    max=\"{{ variant.quantity_rule.max }}\"\n  {% endif %}\n  value=\"{{ variant.quantity_rule.min }}\"\n  required\n>\n```\n\n");
